{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "89a96fb5-12fb-8680-a8a8-f69145f86316",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T13:13:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:10:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Yes. Thank you for picking up so quickly. [pause] I did not think anyone would answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help. What's your name, and what's going on with your bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Min-jun Patel. [pause] I am at 154 Pelham Street. [pause] Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Patel. I have your account up. What questions do you have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The bill. [pause] There are two lines. Water, and sewer. [pause] The sewer is higher. Why is the sewer higher than the water? [pause] I do not think that is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see why that looks odd. The sewer charge is calculated from the water that goes through your meter, but the sewer rate per unit is higher than the water rate. So the sewer line can come out bigger even though it's the same usage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same water. [pause] Two prices. [pause] Hm. I do not like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. It's the same usage figure, billed at two different rates. Now, your usage on this bill is quite a bit above your normal. Do you know of anything that might have caused that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] The toilet. It was running. Constantly. [pause] Last month. [pause] I fixed it after. But the bill is high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would explain it. A running toilet can use a lot of water, and the sewer charge goes up right along with it. The repair is done now, so next month's reading should come back down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so. [pause] Can you write it down for me? The explanation. [pause] In a letter. I want it in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll send a written explanation of the sewer and water charges to the address on the account, 154 Pelham Street. It should reach you in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:12:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. [pause] Thank you. [pause] One more thing. [pause] There was a refund. Earlier. [pause] Did it go to the right card?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at that. Can you give me the last four digits of the card you expect it to go to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four. [pause] Seven. [pause] Two. [pause] Nine. Four seven two nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the refund was issued to the card ending in four seven two nine. It should be on your statement by now, or very shortly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] That is the one. [pause] Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can do for you today, Mr. Patel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] That is all. Thank you again, for answering so fast. [pause] Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:13:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Look for the letter. Take care."
    }
  ],
